WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
Heat a pan of water and
watch the bottom of the pan.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:07.650
Bubbles appear, grow, and
race up to the surface.

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.330
Look inside one bubble.

4
00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:10.430
Is it air?

5
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.430
Is it the water breaking apart?

6
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.130
Or is it nothing at all?

7
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.230
So what's in the bubbles of boiling water?

8
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:22.370
In this mission, you'll sort substances
into elements, compounds and mixtures,

9
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.590
and picture the particles in
a solid, a liquid and a gas.

10
00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.410
You'll name every change of state,

11
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:33.010
and see why the temperature stops
rising while a substance boils.

12
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:37.250
Your mission: explain what fills
the bubbles in boiling water.
